Third-party libraries used at build and run time (not included here)
--------------------------------------------------------------------

Declared in deps.edn and fetched by the Clojure CLI; each is distributed under
its own license, which binary releases must reproduce. Generate the list for a
release from the resolved dependencies (clojure -X:deps list). They include
Clojure and its contrib libraries (EPL-1.0), malli (EPL-2.0), http-kit
(Apache-2.0) and, in the separate wmark-tui binary only, Lanterna (LGPL-3.0).

FFmpeg is not part of this program. It runs as a separate executable; a
download that bundles it must add FFmpeg's own license and source offer.
